      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, im taking a low dose aspirin every morning for my heart stuff. my back has been killing me lately though and i was thinking of taking some advil to help with the ache. i've done both before and it was fine, is it okay to take them together?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
